"**The occasion.** Abū Hurayrah said: the Messenger of Allah ﷺ addressed us and said: “O people, Allah has made Hajj obligatory upon you, so perform Hajj.” A man said: “Every year, O Messenger of Allah?” He remained silent until the man had asked three times. Then the Prophet ﷺ said: “If I had said yes, it would have become obligatory, and you would not have been able to do it.”",
